<h2>Account Notice: Ban</h2>

<p>Hello,</p>

<p>Your account has been banned by an administrator due to a system policy violation.</p>

{{#if reason}}
    <p><strong>Reason specified:</strong> {{reason}}</p>
{{/if}}

{{#if penaltyAmount}}
    <p><strong>Assessed Penalty Fine:</strong> ${{penaltyAmount}}</p>
{{/if}}

<hr />
<p style="color: #666; font-size: 12px;">If you believe this action was taken in error, please contact support.</p>